			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766750101,
					"content": "...Nannina's covering the north, so we'll have Laurent take the east... Right, that's all for now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750102,
					"content": "Heya, Varka!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750103,
					"content": "Huh? Honorary Knight? Paimon? What brings you to my camp?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750104,
						766750105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750104,
					"content": "Just moseying about, happened to run into you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766750106,
					"content": "Not at all! Any camp of the Knights of Favonius is your camp too, so make yourself at home.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750107,
					"content": "Though you should give me a heads up next time so I can have the quartermaster break out the good stuff for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750108,
					"content": "Is this really the expeditionary force's camp? Paimon was expecting it to be a bit more... crowded?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750109,
					"content": "Not many from the force are still stationed here, and of those who are, most are out patrolling. Truth be told... Hahaha, it is a bit of a ghost town.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750110,
					"content": "What are the people left here doing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766750111,
					"content": "Gathering all the Abyss-related intel we can. Naturally, we're focusing on dealing with the Wild Hunt right now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750112,
					"content": "To that end, we're collecting intel from across Nod-Krai. Even with Rerir sealed, things haven't completely quieted down yet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750113,
					"content": "We're also gathering all the Abyss-related intel we can. Situation in Nod-Krai's stable for now, but we must remain vigilant. You never know when the Abyss'll come roaring back.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750114,
					"content": "Intelligence is the foundation of any campaign. It's not just enemy movements — terrain or shifts in the weather can mean the difference between victory and defeat.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750115,
					"content": "Moving forward, we plan to form a long-term partnership with the Northern Intelligence Network, turn this temporary camp into an intelligence station.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750116,
					"content": "A—An intelligence station? Whoa, like the kind in Fontainian spy thrillers!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750117,
					"content": "Haha, as if! Name one book with a camp this lightly defended in it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750118,
					"content": "During these years out on campaign, we've found that different Abyssal disasters are occurring all over Teyvat. They're unnaturally cunning, always shifting, with no two attacks quite going off the same.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750119,
					"content": "I hope to use the Northern Intelligence Network to share our findings, and use that collaboration to keep gathering information on the Abyss.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750120,
					"content": "This isn't any one nation's burden. Every day, countless winds blow through Nod-Krai... I'd say that makes it the perfect place to set up an outpost.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750121,
					"content": "Ohhh, so that's why... So this is \"chivalry\" in action!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750122,
					"content": "Haha! Well, \"chivalry\"'s good and all, but in reality... We've only just established this station, and don't even have a good map of the nearby terrain.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750123,
					"content": "If you stumble across any building materials or intel nearby, don't forget to bring them back with you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750124,
					"content": "Rest assured, you're our Honorary Knight. We'll look after you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750125,
					"content": "Leave it to me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766750126,
					"content": "Ha, one expedition wraps up, another begins.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750127,
					"content": "G—Grand Master! We've got big trouble, Sir!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Winfried"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750128,
					"content": "Oh? What is it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750129,
					"content": "That important guest we were expecting today... He's trapped at the foot of the mountain!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Winfried"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750130,
					"content": "WHAT!? Is it... who I think it is!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750131,
					"content": "Yes, Sir! It's him! Most of our available manpower is tied up in patrols. Who do we reassign...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Winfried"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750132,
					"content": "—No need! Just point me in the right direction, I'll handle it myself! Honorary Knight, Paimon, 'til next time!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750133,
					"content": "Varka storms out like the very wind...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766750134,
					"content": "...Whoa, Paimon's never seen Varka so nervous! Now she's curious who that guest is...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750135,
					"content": "Could it be... a critical informant?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750136
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766750136,
					"content": "Yeah, that's probably it! Let's follow him and see if he needs help!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766750105,
					"content": "Did we interrupt?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766750106
					]
				}
			]
		},
